"},{"type":"p","text":"Customized prosthetic and orthotic components can increasingly be digitally designed and manufactured."},{"type":"h","text":"2. AI-Based Gait Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"AI and computer vision can assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Movement analysis"},{"text":"Gait classification"},{"text":"Asymmetry detection"},{"text":"Rehabilitation monitoring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Smart Prosthetics"},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging systems integrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sensors"},{"text":"Microprocessors"},{"text":"Connectivity"},{"text":"Adaptive control"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Wearable Sensors"},{"type":"h","text":"Used for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gait monitoring"},{"text":"Activity tracking"},{"text":"Rehabilitation assessment"},{"text":"Functional outcome measurement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Digital Twins"},{"type":"p","text":"Digital representations of devices and biomechanical conditions may support future device optimization."},{"type":"h","text":"6. Advanced Materials"},{"type":"h","text":"Development includes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Carbon-fibre composites"},{"text":"Lightweight polymers"},{"text":"Flexible materials"},{"text":"Smart materials"},{"text":"Patient-specific structures"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Human Anatomy"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Biomechanics"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Rehabilitation Science"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Prosthetic & Orthotic Fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Measurement & Casting"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Fabrication & Repair"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Fitting & Alignment"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Gait Analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Communication"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Documentation"},{